@title Cabinet heat: search for a cooler layout and apply it
@area Heat
# A VFD sits under the PLC modules of its cabinet. The command searches in the 2D model, the window shows before and after, Apply moves the devices on their rails as one undo step.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot cabinet-before
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Suggest a cooler layout
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot searching
wait_s 120
expect "Apply the moves"
expect "Model estimate"
shot found
scroll 500 400 -800
wait 4
shot found-scrolled
check_layout
click_text "Apply the moves"
wait 20
expect "Moved"
shot applied
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 20
shot undone
